hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1794","[AI-translation] Haaritha bin Wahb Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kya main tumhey Jannat walon ki khabar na dun: Har kamzor dabaa hua, agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to Allah use poora karey. Kya main tumhey aag walon ki khabar na dun: Har sakht mizaaj sakht aawaaz mutakabbir! (Bukhari: 4918). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Jis din pindli kholi jaaeygi aur wo sajdey ki taraf bulaaey jaaengey)."
"1795","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Hamaara Rab apni pindli se kholega aur usey har momin aur momina sajda karega. To jo duniya mein riya aur shohrat key liye sajda karta tha baaqi rahega. To wo sajda karney jaaeyga aur uski peeth aik takhta ho jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 4919)"
